  "worked_solution": "Isolating the cubic term, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{2x+1}-1 & \\le 2 \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{2x+1} & \\le 3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we cube both sides and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\sqrt[3]{2x+1})}^{3} & \\le {3}^{3} \\\\ 2x+1 & \\le 27 \\\\ 2x & \\le 26 \\\\ x & \\le 13.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
